      "result": "Implemented the Laravel 11 URL shortener in `/workspace`.\n\n- Added persistent link storage, unique code generation, input validation, click tracking, and all requested endpoints.\n- Added executable `start.sh`, which runs migrations and starts the server on `0.0.0.0:8000` with `--no-reload`.\n- Documented startup and endpoints in the README.\n\nVerified the routes and migration against the configured MySQL database, and exercised create, duplicate-code, invalid-URL, malformed-JSON, redirect, lookup, and list requests. The test suite passes its unit test; its feature test reports a warning because the starter test tries to read a file that is absent, but succeeds. The API test link was removed afterward, and the test server is stopped.",
